{"id":"660735","name":"盐葱鸡腿肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660735/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿去骨取肉备用。","img":"images/660735/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净的鸡腿肉加入适量蚝油，老抽，生抽，抓拌均匀腌制半小时以上入味。","img":"images/660735/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香葱洗净切葱花。","img":"images/660735/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜头剁碎备用。","img":"images/660735/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碗里放入蒜末和葱花，白芝麻。","img":"images/660735/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量盐。","img":"images/660735/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"少许芝麻油拌匀备用。","img":"images/660735/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡腿肉。","img":"images/660735/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"中小火慢煎。","img":"images/660735/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/660735/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将盐葱酱均匀铺在鸡腿肉上。","img":"images/660735/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入少许清水和生抽。","img":"images/660735/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖上焖1分钟左右。","img":"images/660735/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"鸡腿肉取出晾凉切块装盘即可。","img":"images/660735/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660735/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660735/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660735/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}